  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">动态树木</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;| &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vampirism-become-a-vampire/files\" rel=\"nofollow\">吸血鬼</a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Harleyoc1/DynamicTreesVampirism/blob/1.12.2/banner.png?raw=true\" width=\"588\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/A4FCBS3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0Prkr13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"166\" height=\"32\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oeSBh9T.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"174\" height=\"32\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">🇺🇸 🇫🇷 🇪🇸 🇲🇽 🇷🇺</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\">&nbsp;<strong>概述</strong></h2>\n<p><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;本模组旨在为动态树木与吸血鬼模组添加兼容性。</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\">&nbsp;<strong>功能特性</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/365/965/bitmap.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"><strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">树木<br></span></strong><strong>1.19.2<br></strong>&nbsp;&bull; 暗云杉<br>&nbsp;&bull; 诅咒云杉</p>\n<p><strong>1.16.5-1.18.2</strong><br>&nbsp;&bull; 吸血鬼云杉<br>&nbsp;&bull; 血腥云杉</p>\n<p><strong>1.12.2</strong><br>&nbsp;&bull; 云杉橡树</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SRb8VX6.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">依赖项</span></strong><br>&nbsp;&bull;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">动态树木</a>&nbsp;[0.9.18+ in 1.12.2] [0.10.0-Beta34+ in 1.16.5] [0.11.0-Beta3+ in 1.18.2] [1.1.0-BETA1+ in 1.19.2]<br>&nbsp;&bull;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vampirism-become-a-vampire/files\" rel=\"nofollow\">吸血鬼</a>&nbsp;[1.16.2+ in 1.12.2] [1.7.10+ in 1.16.5] [1.8.7+ in 1.18.2] [1.9.4+ in 1.19.2]<br>&nbsp;&bull;&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>&nbsp;[14.23.5.2847+ in 1.12.2] [36.2.0+ in 1.16.5] [40.1.0+ in 1.18.2] [43+ in 1.19.2]</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\">许可与整合包</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;特此授权在任何整合包或服务器中使用本模组。既然我已明确告知您可以使用，请勿再反复询问授权事宜，这很令人困扰。所有源代码均可在 <a href=\"https://github.com/Harleyoc1/DynamicTreesVampirism\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 上查看，本项目采用 <a href=\"https://github.com/Harleyoc1/DynamicTreesVampirism/blob/1.16.5/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\">MIT 许可证</a>。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>当前支持的语言翻译版本请参见页面顶部的旗帜图标，更多信息及贡献者名单请 <a href=\"https://github.com/harleyoc1/dynamictreesvampirism#translations\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处</a> 查看。</p>",
